    "title": "WATCH: Nonprofit brings community together to find future of safety in Memphis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago Nonprofit brings community together to find future of safety in Memphis. This week, leaders from both Memphis and Shelby County, along with community organizers and the youth, came together to try to tackle crime. The two-day event was sponsored by a Kentucky non-profit called Cities United. It made a stop in Memphis as part of its Leading the Way Tour, stopping in 20 cities nationwide to help the communities collaborate to fight crime. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
